  {
    "id": 2006006010010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あ……プロデュ──",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600601/2006006010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もしもし、咲耶！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006010020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……すまない、その声からして、心配をかけていたようだね\r\n大丈夫、私は無事だよ。ただ……少し道に迷ってしまってね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600601/2006006010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006010030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今日のロケ地は初めて行く場所だから\r\nスマホの地図を頼りに向かっていたんだけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600601/2006006010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006010040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "どうやら、GPSがうまく作動していなかったみたいで、\r\n違う場所に着いてしまったんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600601/2006006010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか\r\n俺の都合で現地集合にしたばっかりに、悪かったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はどこにいるかわかるか？\r\n何か目印になるものがあったら教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006010050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ふむ、目印か……ちょうど目の前に\r\n真っ青で丸い窓が特徴的なビルが見えるけれど──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600601/2006006010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこなら、もう近くまで来てるぞ\r\n時間も……うん、集合時間には間に合いそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すぐに迎えに行くから、そのまま待っていてくれるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006010060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……いや、もし迷うような道でないのなら\r\nこのまま道案内を頼みたい",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600601/2006006010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006010070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "待っているよりも、自分から向かう方が性に合っている\r\n時間のロスも減らせるし……どうかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600601/2006006010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな。でも、焦らなくていいから\r\nくれぐれも注意して来てくれよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ。これ以上プロデューサーに\r\n心配をかけるわけにはいかないからね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600601/2006006010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006006010090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それじゃあ、まずはどの方向へ行けばいいのか\r\n教えてくれないかい？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600601/2006006010090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
